---
// Architecture of the C++ engine (matching-engine-cpp/engine.cpp), drawn in currentColor so it
// works in both themes. 16:7.
---

<figure class="my-6">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 960 420" class="h-auto w-full text-ink" role="img" aria-labelledby="arch-t arch-d">
    <title id="arch-t">Architecture of the matching engine</title>
    <desc id="arch-d">Client connections each get a thread. A thread looks up the instrument book in a shared map guarded by a mutex, locks that book, then releases the map. Each instrument book has its own mutex and two priority queues, buys by highest price then earliest time, sells by lowest price then earliest time. A second map from order id to instrument and side, also guarded by a mutex, lets cancels find the book. Matches are written to the output as executions.</desc>
    <defs>
      <marker id="arr" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
        <path d="M0 0L10 5L0 10z" fill="currentColor"></path>
      </marker>
    </defs>
    <g font-family="IBM Plex Mono, ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="13" fill="currentColor">
      <g stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5">
        <rect x="20" y="40" width="150" height="56" rx="8"></rect>
        <rect x="20" y="182" width="150" height="56" rx="8"></rect>
        <rect x="20" y="324" width="150" height="56" rx="8"></rect>
        <rect x="250" y="40" width="170" height="340" rx="8" stroke-dasharray="5 4"></rect>
        <rect x="490" y="40" width="200" height="110" rx="8"></rect>
        <rect x="490" y="270" width="200" height="110" rx="8"></rect>
        <rect x="770" y="40" width="170" height="140" rx="8"></rect>
        <rect x="770" y="240" width="170" height="140" rx="8"></rect>
      </g>
      <text x="95" y="73" text-anchor="middle">client 1</text>
      <text x="95" y="215" text-anchor="middle">client 2</text>
      <text x="95" y="357" text-anchor="middle">client n</text>
      <text x="95" y="146" text-anchor="middle" opacity=".6">⋮</text>

      <text x="335" y="70" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="600">one thread</text>
      <text x="335" y="88" text-anchor="middle">per connection</text>
      <text x="335" y="200" text-anchor="middle">buy · sell</text>
      <text x="335" y="218" text-anchor="middle">· cancel</text>

      <text x="590" y="72" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="600">instrument lookup</text>
      <text x="590" y="94" text-anchor="middle">name → book</text>
      <text x="590" y="124" text-anchor="middle" opacity=".7">guarded by a mutex</text>
      <text x="590" y="302" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="600">order lookup</text>
      <text x="590" y="324" text-anchor="middle">id → (name, side)</text>
      <text x="590" y="354" text-anchor="middle" opacity=".7">guarded by a mutex</text>

      <text x="855" y="70" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="600">book: AAPL</text>
      <text x="855" y="96" text-anchor="middle">buys: max price,</text>
      <text x="855" y="114" text-anchor="middle">then earliest</text>
      <text x="855" y="138" text-anchor="middle">sells: min price…</text>
      <text x="855" y="164" text-anchor="middle" opacity=".7">own mutex</text>
      <text x="855" y="270" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="600">book: GOOG</text>
      <text x="855" y="296" text-anchor="middle">two priority</text>
      <text x="855" y="314" text-anchor="middle">queues</text>
      <text x="855" y="364" text-anchor="middle" opacity=".7">own mutex</text>
      <text x="855" y="214" text-anchor="middle" opacity=".6">⋮</text>

      <g stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none" marker-end="url(#arr)">
        <path d="M170 68H248"></path>
        <path d="M170 210H248"></path>
        <path d="M170 352H248"></path>
        <path d="M420 95H488"></path>
        <path d="M420 325H488"></path>
        <path d="M690 95H768"></path>
        <path d="M690 120Q730 200 768 300"></path>
        <path d="M590 270V152" stroke-dasharray="4 4"></path>
      </g>
      <text x="602" y="186" font-size="11" opacity=".75">lock book,</text>
      <text x="602" y="201" font-size="11" opacity=".75">then release map</text>
      <text x="580" y="222" font-size="11" opacity=".75" text-anchor="end">cancel: find book</text>
    </g>
  </svg>
  <figcaption class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">Fig. 1 · Drawn from <code class="mono text-[13px]">engine.cpp</code>. A thread holds the map lock only long enough to find and lock one book, so orders for different instruments don't wait on each other. Executions go to the output as they happen.</figcaption>
</figure>
